        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:223.49795532226562,244.21376037597656,2841.7049255371094,3951.5533294677734",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, left side\u00a0",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>A decree has been made concerning the protection of the shipowners in al-Nastar\u0101wiyya and the prevention of the requisitioning of their vessels</li>\n<li>and the prevention of people from al-\u0120arbiyya</li>\n<li>from fishing along the shore.</li>\n<li>Mark</li>\n<li>A gracious decree.</li>\n<li>At the top there is the motto (written) in the noble hand:</li>\n<li>Praise be to God, lord of the universe.</li>\n<li>Its copy.</li>\n<li>Since it has been reported to the presense of the commander of the faithful that merchant</li>\n<li>shipowners living in the province of al-Nastar\u0101wiyya and in towns bordering upon this region</li>\n<li>are travelling to the sea coasts of al-Bu\u1e25ayra, al-&Scaron;arqiyya,</li>\n<li>al-\u0120arbiyya and the frontier region of Alexandria - may God protect her -</li>\n<li>to make purchases from the said provinces and that</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
    {
      "etag": "\"b8596d1e162c7aafc3520631afcc0f29\"",
