        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:3152.66015625,238.22784423828125,2548.59716796875,3907.9523315429688",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, right side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>those who seek to gain access to anything thereof that is forbidden to them or that is disallowed</li>\n<li>and those who regard as permissible what is not permissible for them. Let the chosen \u02beam\u012br,</li>\n<li>(3&ndash;4) the diligent representative of its d\u012bw\u0101n - may God save it - (and all the \u02beam\u012brs, governors and employees) ensure that</li>\n<li></li>\n<li>the commands and prohibitions contained in this decree are carried out. Let him stand within the bounds of</li>\n<li>his office in loyalty and absolute obedience,</li>\n<li>and let him seek to ameliorate the lot of the merchants, protect them from,&nbsp;</li>\n<li>all harm and damage, set right the affairs of the \u1e0d\u0101mins</li>\n<li>in their \u1e0dam\u0101n and levy their dues in full according to the praiseworthy and prospering law.</li>\n<li>(Let this be done) after this decree has been registered in the auspicious office of inspection</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 2
    },
