      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, right side, margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>of al-\u1e24\u0101fi\u1e93 and its registration where such documents are registered. It was written when nine days remained of the month Rab\u012b\u02bf I,</li>\n<li>in the year five-hundred and twenty-eight.</li></ol>\n",
